"Your account (%(username)s) on Baserow (%(baserow_embedded_share_hostname)s) "
"will be permanently deleted in %(days_left)s days."
msgstr ""
"Votre compte (%(username)s) sur Baserow "
"(%(baserow_embedded_share_hostname)s) sera définitivement supprimé dans "
"%(days_left)s jours."

