"compte, il vous suffit de vous reconnecter."

#: src/baserow/core/templates/baserow/core/user/change_email_confirmation.html:173
msgid "Confirm email address change"
msgstr "Confirmer le changement d'adresse e-mail"

#: src/baserow/core/templates/baserow/core/user/change_email_confirmation.html:178
#, python-format
msgid ""
"A request was made to change the email address for your Baserow account from "
"%(old_email)s to %(new_email)s on Baserow "
"(%(baserow_embedded_share_hostname)s). If you did not authorize this, you "
"may simply ignore this email."
msgstr ""
"Une demande de modification de l'adresse e-mail de votre compte Baserow de "
"%(old_email)s à %(new_email)s a été effectuée sur Baserow "
"(%(baserow_embedded_share_hostname)s). Si vous ne l'avez pas autorisée, vous "
"pouvez ignorer cet e-mail."

#: src/baserow/core/templates/baserow/core/user/change_email_confirmation.html:183
#, python-format
msgid ""
"To confirm your email address change, simply click the button below. This "
"link will expire in %(hours)s hours."
msgstr ""
"Pour confirmer le changement d'adresse e-mail, cliquez sur le bouton ci-"
"dessous. Ce lien expirera dans %(hours)s heures."

#: src/baserow/core/templates/baserow/core/user/change_email_confirmation.html:192
msgid "Confirm email change"
msgstr "Confirmer le changement d'adresse e-mail"

