msgstr "Merci d'utiliser Baserow"

#: src/baserow/core/templates/baserow/core/user/email_pending_verification.html:183
msgid ""
"To keep your account secure, please take a moment to verify your email by "
"clicking the button below. Your email address will be used to assist you in "
"changing your Baserow password should you ever need to in the future."
msgstr ""
"Pour sécuriser votre compte, prenez un instant pour vérifier votre adresse e-"
"mail en cliquant sur le bouton ci-dessous. Elle pourra vous aider à modifier "
"votre mot de passe Baserow si nécessaire."

#: src/baserow/core/templates/baserow/core/user/email_pending_verification.html:192
msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "Confirmer"

#: src/baserow/core/templates/baserow/core/user/password_changed.html:173
